        <mxCell id="lg3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" value="Fill = stage (header colour of each column). Bold-bordered nodes = the four core RTI items.&lt;br&gt;† = preview · ‡ = reported GA (Gartner, Oct 2026) — not yet confirmed against Microsoft docs.&lt;br&gt;Real-Time Hub and OneLake are planes spanning all stages, not steps in the flow." vertex="1">
